cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Latch Benchmark Suite, please cite it as below."
title: "Latch Benchmark Suite (LBS)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "iome-sh contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/iome-sh"
repository-code: "https://github.com/iome-sh/latch-bench"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  Benchmark suite for in-process robot mode-election planes.
  Measures signed mode-election quality (determinism, chatter damp,
  consider latency, evidence verify, yield≠stop honesty).
  Not a grasp-success suite, SIL/ISO cert pack, or BehaviorTree product.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - mode-election
  - benchmarks
  - mujoco
  - ros2
  - validation
